"<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f3f0e8\" style=\"background-color:#f3f0e8;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#f3f0e8\" style=\"background-color:#f3f0e8;padding:10px 10px 32px 10px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/header-compact.png\" width=\"520\" alt=\"SIGHTLINE \u00b7 Logic Puzzle\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:520px;height:auto;border:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;\"></td></tr>\n\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;padding:18px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">Hi Pieter,</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">I\u2019m Yoni, a former Rockstar Games designer and founder of Yumloop Games, an independent Scottish studio.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">I\u2019m looking for a publishing partner for Sightline, an original deduction puzzle game preparing for release on Steam and mobile, with Nintendo Switch also under consideration.</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- SIGHTLINE -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#trailer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/sightline-portals.gif\" width=\"554\" alt=\"Sightline gameplay: lines of sight passing through portals\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:554px;height:auto;border:0;border-bottom:3px solid #000000;\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;padding:16px 18px 18px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Every clue has a point of view.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Sightline is a deduction puzzle where walls block sightlines, mirrors redirect them and portals connect distant parts of the board. Every puzzle is solvable through logic alone, without guessing, and every board is checked by a solver before it ships.</p>\n\n<!-- the numbers -->\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#fff3c4\" style=\"background-color:#fff3c4;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 16px 0;\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:12px 10px 10px 14px;border-right:2px solid #000000;border-bottom:2px solid #000000;\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">700</span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:#1a1a1a;\">Levels</span></td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:12px 10px 10px 14px;border-bottom:2px solid #000000;\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">2&ndash;16</span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:#1a1a1a;\">Players, cross-platform multiplayer</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:12px 10px 12px 14px;border-right:2px solid #000000;\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">6</span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:#1a1a1a;\">Platforms, cross-platform progression &amp; leaderboards</span></td>\n<td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:50%;padding:12px 10px 12px 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">0</span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:#1a1a1a;\">Guesses needed</span></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\"><b>Elimination multiplayer.</b> 2 to 16 players race on the same boards. One mistake and you\u2019re out, with phones and PCs in the same match.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\"><b>Grand Levels.</b> A second campaign of 300 large boards drawn as pictures, made for iPad, PC, Mac and Steam Deck.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#0040f7\" style=\"background-color:#0040f7;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;\"><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#builds\" style=\"display:block;padding:12px 20px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Play Sightline &rarr;</span></a></td>\n</tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;\">\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch\" style=\"color:#0040f7;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">Full pitch</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline-pitch#trailer\" style=\"color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:underline;\">Trailer</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4509520/\" style=\"color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:underline;\">Steam page</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- SIGHTLINE 3D -->\n<tr><td>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;\">\n<tr><td width=\"8\" bgcolor=\"#a040d8\" style=\"width:8px;background-color:#a040d8;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;padding:16px 18px 16px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Also playable: Sightline 3D</p>\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch#trailer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://yumloop.net/mail/sightline3d-hero-480.gif\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Sightline 3D gameplay: a line of sight wrapping round a cube\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:400px;height:auto;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;\"></a>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 14px 0;\">I\u2019ve also developed Sightline 3D, a separate, fully playable second game that takes the same deduction mechanics into three dimensions: 401 solver-checked levels on solid shapes, turn buttons, islands linked by portals, and its own 16-player Elimination mode.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\"><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#a040d8\" style=\"background-color:#a040d8;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;\"><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch#builds\" style=\"display:block;padding:10px 16px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Play Sightline 3D &rarr;</span></a></td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 0 0 14px;\"><a href=\"https://yumloop.net/sightline3d-pitch\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#a040d8;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Full pitch</a></td>\n</tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<!-- PLATFORMS -->\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px 16px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Both games, every screen</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\">Both run today on iPhone, iPad, Android, Windows, Mac and Steam Deck, with cross-save, global leaderboards and multiplayer across all of them. Neither is a stretched phone port: one-handed portrait play on phones, wider layouts for iPad, foldables and PC, and full controller support on Steam Deck.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;\"><b>Apple Arcade.</b> A strong candidate, subject to Apple\u2019s approval: premium, uninterrupted puzzle play with no ads.</td></tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;\"><b>Steam, Mac and desktop.</b> Hundreds of extra levels made for the wider screen, controller customisation and touch screen support, with Sightline\u2019s store page live ahead of launch.</td></tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;\"><b>Nintendo Switch.</b> Touch in handheld mode and controller when docked, suited to short puzzle sessions.</td></tr>\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0;\"><b>Mobile.</b> iOS and Android, with layouts tailored to phones, tablets and foldables.</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td height=\"14\" style=\"height:14px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td bgcolor=\"#1a1a1a\" style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;border:3px solid #000000;border-radius:4px;padding:18px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#ffffff;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;color:#ffffff;\">Both games are available to evaluate, including desktop evaluation builds with multiplayer, and I\u2019d welcome a conversation about either title individually or a broader publishing partnership.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#ffffff;\">Would you be open to a short call?</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"padding:18px 4px 0 4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#1a1a1a;\">\n<span style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\">Yoni</span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#6f6b64;\">Founder, Yumloop Games</span><br>\n<a href=\"mailto:yoni@yumloop.net\" style=\"color:#0040f7;text-decoration:none;\">yoni@yumloop.net</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://yumloop.net\" style=\"color:#0040f7;text-decoration:none;\">https://yumloop.net</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>"